    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "professional help is just more noise. it doesnt change the fact that the \"me\" that mattered is dead. people only liked the version of me that existed online. now that they've all turned their backs and that person is erased... what am i even supposed to do with the leftovers? i'm just a shell. it feels more like a funeral for someone who is still breathing.",
